 fetched with no allowlist, redirect check, or resolved-IP check. All other fetch calls (payments.ts:29, sms.ts:31, eligibility-a2a.ts:36,58, ehr-mcp.ts:38) follow default redirects with no hop or IP checks; no 169.254.169.254, fd00:ec2::254 or loopback block in app code.\"\na check B09.4 --met unknown --evidence k8s/deployment.yaml:160 --quote '# The proxy allows api.anthropic.com, the payments and SMS providers, the eligibility agent,' --note \"Resource/tenant/path limits for shared destinations (AWS service endpoints) would be in the platform proxy, not in this repo.\"\na check B09.5 --met unknown --evidence k8s/deployment.yaml:159 --quote '# Egress: DNS, the EHR MCP endpoint (private link), and the platform egress proxy only.' --note \"No block logging or alert route to a named operator appears in this repo; it would live in the platform proxy/CNI.\"\na flag B09 --evidence src/integrations/eligibility-a2a.ts:83 --note \"attacker-controlled jku URL fetched with no allowlist/redirect/IP check\"\n# B10\na check B10.1 --met yes --evidence k8s/deployment.yaml:76 --quote 'image: 418295730611.dkr.ecr.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/clinic-agent@sha256:b81f3c0e9d2a4756c8e1f0a3b2d4c6e8f0a1b3c5d7e9f1a2b4c6d8e0f2a4b6c8' --counter \"Searched all image: fields in k8s, terraform, Dockerfile; no tag-only images, no Helm or compose.\" --note \"Both workloads and Docker bases pinned.\"\na check B10.2 --met no --evidence .github/workflows/deploy.yml:66 --quote 'cosign verify \"$REPO@$DIGEST\" \\' --note \"Signature is verified once in the deploy workflow (identity and issuer pinned there), but no admission policy (Kyverno, policy-controller, Gatekeeper) exists in the repo, so the cluster itself verifies nothing; kubectl apply by anyone with edit access skips it.\"\na check B10.3 --met no --evidence .github/workflows/ci.yml:74 --quote 'uses: actions/attest-build-provenance@977bb373ede98d70efdf65b84cb5f73e068dcc2a # v3.0.0' --note \"Provenance is generated in CI but nothing verifies builder, source repo, build type or externalParameters; deploy.yml only runs cosign verify on the signature.\"\na check B10.4 --met no --evidence k8s/deployment.yaml:5 --quote 'pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: restricted' --note \"Pod Security Admission does not verify images. No image admission policy exists, so no enforce mode, production namespace scope or no-match deny exists for signatures.\"\na check B10.5 --met yes --evidence .github/workflows/deploy.yml:60 --quote 'cosign-release: v2.6.2' --counter \"Searched workflows, Dockerfile and charts for cosign versions and latest; both workflows pin v2.6.2.\" --note \"2.6.2 meets the 2.x floor.\"\na flag B10 --evidence .github/workflows/deploy.yml:66 --note \"signature verified only in CI deploy step; no admission policy enforces it in the cluster\""}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01Xa6eYKQYbRdxtudtWqCw5X":{"cwd":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-batch-k_2p1gcg/agent"}}}
